Wait: quotient.setScale(6) — if quotient scale ≤ 6, setScale(6) pads zeros exactly. If scale > 6 we already threw. But stripTrailingZeros().scale() > 6 check: e.g. 16.6666665 scale 7 → strip → scale 7 → throw. 30.0000000 → strip → 30 scale 0 → ok. Edge: quotient like 1E+2 (negative scale) → setScale(6) fine.

