                    req.mass(), binding.stateVersion() + 1, conformance.ingredients(),
                    conformance.conforms(), Instant.parse(now));
            return new StoredResponse(201, toJson(body));
        });
    }

    // === 更正、查询、放行门禁、拆分继承见下段 ===
}

